{'symbol': 'NI', 'date': '2021-11-03 06:30:00', 'title': 'NISOURCE REPORTS THIRD QUARTER 2021 RESULTS', 'text': 'MERRILLVILLE, IND., NOV. 3, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0NISOURCE INC. (NYSE: NI) TODAY ANNOUNCED, ON A GAAP BASIS, NET INCOME AVAILABLE TO COMMON SHAREHOLDERS FOR THE THREE MONTHS ENDED SEPTEMBER\xa030, 2021 OF $49.4 MILLION, OR $0.12 DILUTED EARNINGS PER SHARE, COMPARED TO NET LOSS AVAILABLE TO COMMON SHAREHOLDERS OF $186.7 MILLION, OR $0.49 DILUTED LOSS PER SHARE, FOR THE SAME PERIOD OF 2020.'}